<title>USA: Moore lands $100 million contract.</title>
<headline>Moore lands $100 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Corp Ltd said Wednesday it signed a four-year, sole-source contract valued at $100 million with University HealthSystem Consortium of Oak Brook, Ill., a large U.S. healthcare consortium.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Moore will provide business communication management products and services, enabling member hospitals to reduce document-related costs.</p>
<p>University HealthSystem is an alliance of more than 100 not-for-profit academic health centers and their network partners. Moore Corp designs and manufactures communications products.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
